' 4. Take a lesson
' Use case: Take a lesson (Learn Japanese) · Actor: Learner
'
' Design patterns:
'   - Repository: lesson progress, XP events, achievements
'   - Unit of work: each XP award (XP event + total + streak day) is one transaction (services/xp.service.ts)
'   - Observer: achievement and level-up notifications are published to the learner's open tabs
'     (services/realtime.service.ts publish → RealtimeBus → web lib/realtime.ts)
'   - Decorator: action() around the controller
'   (XP amounts and achievement rules are rule tables in src/gamification/, not a design pattern)
' Lifelines use BCE stereotypes: «boundary» screens and outside services, «control» use-case logic (controllers,
' services, and the adapter interfaces in front of outside services), «entity» stored data (repository, stores);
' the database keeps its own symbol.
@startuml 04 Take a lesson
title 4. Take a lesson
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Learner
boundary "Web app" as Web
control "Lesson controller" as Ctrl
control "Lesson-completion\nservice" as Svc
control "XP service" as XP
control "Gamification\nservice" as Gam
entity "Repository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB
control "Notification\n(realtime)" as Notif

Learner -> Web : open a lesson
Web -> Web : load the lesson content (its unit's file + any published admin edit)
Web -> Ctrl : GET /api/lessons/:lessonId/access
Ctrl -> Repo : previous lesson done? unit unlocked? level reached?
alt locked
  Ctrl --> Web : 403 + reasons
  Web --> Learner : "Lesson locked"
end
Ctrl --> Web : allowed
Learner -> Web : vocabulary → concept → conversation → practice → challenge (in the browser)
Web -> Ctrl : POST /api/lessons/:lessonId/complete (challenge score)
Ctrl -> Svc : completeLesson()
Svc -> Repo : save lesson score
Repo -> DB : UPSERT lesson_progress
group «Unit of work» awardXP(): once per lesson
  Svc -> XP : lesson XP (50)
  XP -> Repo : lock XP, insert XP event, add XP, record streak day
  Repo -> DB : INSERT / UPDATE
end
opt challenge score 100%
  Svc -> XP : perfect challenge XP (25), once per lesson
end
Ctrl -> Gam : celebrate(awards)
Gam -> Repo : learner facts → achievements now earned
loop each new achievement
  Gam -> XP : achievement XP
  Gam -> Notif : notifyAchievement()
end
opt new level
  Gam -> Notif : notifyLevelUp()
end
Notif -> DB : save notifications
Notif --> Web : «Observer» publish → bell updates in every open tab
Ctrl --> Web : completion, achievements, reward
Web --> Learner : "+XP" pop-up, level up / achievement
Web -> Ctrl : POST /api/mistakes/lessons/:lessonId (challenge answers)
note right of Web : wrong answers go to\nthe mistake notebook
@enduml
